      "standardized_narrative": "The syndicate opened 2024 with gross claims outstanding of 3,416.9m USD. During 2024 there was an overall release of prior year reserves of 25.8m USD (a ~0.75% release of opening gross reserves), driven predominantly by favourable claims development principally in Treaty, Property and Casualty divisions, partially offset by reserve strengthening related to political risk and violence (notably linked to the Russian invasion of Ukraine). The movement is explicitly shown in Note 19 (Change in estimates of prior year provisions: -25,782k USD gross).",
